se,"text":"妹・梨恵と仲良く暮らしていければ、それでいいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19027","sourceWorkId":"10176","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大宮司グループ総帥の愛娘。双子の令嬢の姉。名門女学園に通う、苦労知らずのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転が速いが、高慢で毒舌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"肩書きに惹かれて寄ってくる大人達を何よりも汚らわしく、否定的に思っており、自然と人を遠ざけるような尊大な態度をとっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、妹の梨恵と仲良く暮らしていければ、それでいいと思っている。梨恵の髪を梳かすのが趣味。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148928"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64251f77c68778c7358b635a5b3791930491bb8ccbb560ceee9d3415579c97ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06252359e804f146fcee2b89816e60a3158f7fce47f112d51b4c3c72c24b3209.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽吹梨里","creatorId":"vndb:s57","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s57","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s57","name":"羽吹 梨里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230387:148928:6547:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49778","characterName":"大宮司 梨恵","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148929","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230387"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19028"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49778"},"originalCharacterName":"大宮司 梨恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大宮司グループ総帥の愛娘で、双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしていて、人の悪意に気づかない天然タイプだが、誰にでも甘えるような性格のため、自然と人を惹きつける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、世間知らずな発言が、周りに嫌味と取られることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19028","sourceWorkId":"10176","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大宮司グループ総帥の愛娘。双子の令嬢の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格で、人の悪意に気づきにくい天然気質の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし姉と違い、裏表なく誰にでも甘えるような性格のため、自然と人が集まってきやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"育ちのよさ故の世間知らずの発言が、周りに嫌味ととられる事もある。甘いものがなによりの好物。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148929"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76ffa1b094b5a544568705e3fb8d1da1357a2474dc0fa36e96b4a345fbffb410.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c90d348373e9d9ec10256efcfb455a96afecb1b41848532116441ec8803f45a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230387:148929:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49779","characterName":"津田 閑","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148930","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230387"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19029"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49779"},"originalCharacterName":"津田 閑","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の上司で、祁答院グループ暗躍部の室長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷血な実力主義者だが、その素顔を笑顔で隠している女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「祁答院グループの礎を築いたのは彼女である」といっても過言ではないほどの力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の才能を見抜き、暗躍部へ引き抜いたり、大宮司壊滅作戦に主人公を抜擢したりと、両者の信頼は厚い様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女だが、小動物が好きという意外な一面も。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19029","sourceWorkId":"10176","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"祁答院グループ暗躍部・室長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に笑顔を張り付かせているが、それは内情を悟られないための分厚い皮。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷血で慧敏な実力主義者であり、「津田 閑」という名も当然の如く偽名である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、結平の才能を看破して暗躍部に引き込んだのも閑で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の大宮司壊滅作戦に結平を抜擢したのも彼女であり、両者の信頼は厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祁答院グループは閑によって礎を築けたと言っても過言はなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女に頭の上がる者は数えるほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒い噂だけが一人歩きしているが、小動物が好きという一面も持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148930"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/8850a9c8c8a275ae9508b739e5bee8a434c5d6cb4f8b8aaceaec447ef1c5af58.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/0595ebc92d81b733da7dc54cbbd68c59dcd8bf50e602f80a0988d2c52a5e16e7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若泉絵子","creatorId":"vndb:s1099","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1099","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1099","name":"若泉 絵子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230387:148930:25167:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49776","characterName":"鏡 結平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49776"},"originalCharacterName":"鏡 結平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26a961b0e887c033f980afca7ea932078723b356729164229ab20818140eed57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c00a4c5274756d81662b72a5f16a2fb8199b5987d683b39c4c969228f8b9213.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c49780","characterName":"言迷","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c49780"},"originalCharacterName":"言迷","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","statu